<thead><tr><th scope="col">Metabolic syndrome（任 3 項／共 5 項）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>1. Abdominal obesity</td></tr>
<tr><td>2. Serum triglycerides <strong class="ex-n">≥150 mg/dL</strong>（或治療中）</td></tr>
<tr><td>3. HDL-C 男 <strong class="ex-n">&lt;40 mg/dL</strong>、女 <strong class="ex-n">&lt;50 mg/dL</strong>（或治療中）</td></tr>
